# bats runs every @test in its own process, which ShellCheck models as a
# subshell; variable changes inside a test are intentionally local to it.
# Tests also set variables that only the sourced library reads (SC2034),
# e.g. arrays passed by name to td_task_edit. Stubs that replace library
# functions are called by the library, not by the tests (SC2329). Globals such
# as TD_TB come from the sourced library (SC2153).
disable=SC2030,SC2031,SC2034,SC2329,SC2153
